OL,3,GNEWSACouncil confirms new
OL,4,Apothole-fixing machine trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeicestershire County Council has
OL,7,Fconfirmed it will carry out a trial of
OL,8,Fa machine used to fix potholes - after
OL,9,Fhighways officials previously said it
OL,10,Fdid not "stack up as an economical
OL,11,Fpiece of kit".
OL,13,FThe Reform UK-led authority said it
OL,14,Fplanned to test out the Pothole Pro
OL,15,Flater this year to explore whether it
OL,16,Fcould serve as a long-term solution to
OL,17,Fmending the county's crumbling roads.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
