OL,3,GNEWSACouncil confirms new
OL,4,Apothole-fixing machine trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, council highways
OL,7,Fofficers released a report, after
OL,8,Fassessing the machine's performance,
OL,9,Fwhich concluded it was "too big" to
OL,10,Fdeploy efficiently.
OL,12,FHowever, the council has now said it
OL,13,Fwill look again at the machine after
OL,14,Fsenior Reform councillors visited
OL,15,Fmanufacturer JCB this week.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
